@SmartX.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5074

### Root health check
GET {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/

### Deployment tree
GET {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/deployment-tree

### List all registered sensors
GET {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/sensors

### Get one sensor
GET {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/sensors/24:6F:28:A1:00:01

### Register a new sensor (valid path)
POST {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/sensors
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "macAddress": "AA:BB:CC:DD:EE:FF",
  "deploymentPathSegments": ["Smart-X Root", "Facility A", "Zone 1", "Sub-Zone B", "Node 12"],
  "category": 0
}

### Register a sensor with an invalid/broken deployment path (expect 400)
POST {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/sensors
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "macAddress": "11:22:33:44:55:66",
  "deploymentPathSegments": ["Smart-X Root", "Facility A", "Zone 9", "Ghost Node"],
  "category": 0
}

### Live telemetry pulses (Mesh Pulse engagement feed)
GET {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/telemetry/pulses

### Flattened historical readings for a seeded sensor
GET {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/telemetry/history/24:6F:28:A1:00:01?take=10

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Part 2 - Real-Time Command Stream
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Ingest a float moisture reading (expect 202, FIFO lane)
POST {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/telemetry/ingest
Content-Type: application/json

{ "macAddress": "24:6F:28:A1:00:02", "moisture": 44.5 }

### Ingest an int wattage spike (expect 202, Priority lane, critical alert raised once)
POST {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/telemetry/ingest
Content-Type: application/json

{ "macAddress": "B4:E6:2D:C2:11:04", "watts": 4300 }

### Ingest a bool valve state
POST {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/telemetry/ingest
Content-Type: application/json

{ "macAddress": "7C:9E:BD:33:22:07", "valveOpen": true }

### Unknown MAC (expect 404 - rejected by the O(1) dictionary lookup)
POST {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/telemetry/ingest
Content-Type: application/json

{ "macAddress": "FF:FF:FF:FF:FF:FF", "moisture": 40 }

### SIMULATE CRITICAL ALERT - queues a routine backlog then one critical packet; the critical one is processed first
POST {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/simulate/critical-alert?mac=24:6F:28:A1:00:02

### Simulate a disconnect (run twice: the second call is ignored as a duplicate)
POST {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/simulate/disconnect/24:6F:28:A1:00:03

### Active alert set (HashSet of unique error states)
GET {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/stream/alerts

### Snapshot: devices, recent readings, alerts, queue stats
GET {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/stream/snapshot

### Timeline for one device (sorted by timestamp)
GET {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/stream/history/24:6F:28:A1:00:02?take=50

### Close all valves
POST {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/commands
Content-Type: application/json

{ "commandType": 4 }

### Trigger Pump A
POST {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/commands
Content-Type: application/json

{ "commandType": 0, "targetMac": "7C:9E:BD:33:22:06" }

### Undo the last command (409 when the stack is empty)
POST {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/commands/undo

### Command stack and actuator states
GET {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/commands

### Suggested actions and automated insights
GET {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/insights

### Record a search with the action engine
POST {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/insights/search
Content-Type: application/json

{ "searchText": "Power Meter A" }

### Part 3 - history range query (AVL tree), last hour of history by default
GET {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/history/Moisture Sensor C

### Part 3 - history range query with an explicit range and paging (times are UTC)
GET {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/history/24:6F:28:A1:00:03?from=2026-11-12T14:00:00Z&to=2026-11-12T16:00:00Z&page=1&pageSize=50

### Part 3 - full topology: nodes, links, reachability and the MST
GET {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/topology

### Part 3 - BFS reachability from the gateway
GET {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/topology/reachability

### Part 3 - Prim's minimum spanning tree and its total cost
GET {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/topology/mst

### Part 3 - one device's route to the gateway (MAC or name)
GET {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/topology/route/Moisture Sensor C

### Part 3 - take Pump A down (Moisture Sensor C reroutes via Moisture Sensor D)
POST {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/simulate/disconnect/7C:9E:BD:33:22:06

### Part 3 - bring Pump A back (routes heal back)
POST {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/simulate/reconnect/7C:9E:BD:33:22:06
